The only thing that I'm not sure about is "what we mean by 'evolution'." To me, it sounds like you are using the word to mean "natural evolution" as opposed to "artificial evolution." In other words, your use of the term "evolution" includes a distinction between artificial and natural.

However, the way you have been using the term seems to be closer to "natural evolution," which is what I'm referring to. So, I'm wondering if you have a better word for it, or if you are using the word to mean "natural evolution" and I'm just confused.

